<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-AMSTERDAM OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AMSTERDAM OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of quarter-finals at the Amsterdam  Open men's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Christian Ruud (Norway)  6-3 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>1-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat 8-Francisco Clavet (Spain)  6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Played Thursday:</p>
<p>Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) beat 6-Javier Sanchez (Spain) 7-6 (7-5)  6-1</p>
<p>Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) beat John van Lottum (Netherlands)  6-4 4-6 6-2.</p>
</text>
